<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#english-language">Glossary</a> · Term · language</p><h1 class="enc-title">English language</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">English is a Germanic language that originated in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a>. Spread across the world by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-empire">British Empire</a> through settlement, administration, education and trade, it became the language of government and elites in many colonies and is now one of the most widely spoken languages, a major legacy of British imperialism.</p></div>
